  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi></math> diagram, a monoatomic gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is first compressed adiabatically from state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. Then it expands isothermally from state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> to state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>. [Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math>].</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0007_430c77f4b81d.jpg\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 201px;\" /></p><p>Which of the following statement(s) is(are) correct?</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of the total work done in the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>144</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of the work done in the process&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>84</mn><mi>kJ</mi></math>.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of the work done in the process&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mi>kJ</mi></math>.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of the work done in the process&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is zero.",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B",
    "C",
